# Cloudflare response headers (copied to dist/ by Vite).

# Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer, so the WASM (CPU) fallback runs multi-threaded.
# `credentialless` still allows loading models from huggingface.co and the runtime from jsDelivr.
# No Referer: huggingface.co rejects requests whose Referer is a *.workers.dev address (404/503),
# which breaks model downloads. This also covers the model worker, whose script gets these headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

# Built files have content hashes in their names, so they can be cached forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
